    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "We have immense gratitude to folks globally who will be bringing this book to life with dana, layout, printing, and distribution including Chan Lai Fun and Hor Tuck Loon."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2471 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2455,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_825 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "23bf01081890ae02c13cf86408a79d1e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "It's difficult to practice being mindful when speaking and seeing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2472 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_1129,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_124,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_18,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2455,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_825 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1d5d1867ed3cc1c467d1330e1db40559"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The reasons are that we don't practice being mindful when speaking, seeing, and looking and we also don't have enough momentum in our awareness."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2473 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2474,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_436,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_517,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_99 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "97123e7fc4a610a21b068c5d80a0984d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The whole point of my retreats is that I'm teaching you a skill that you're supposed to bring into your life, and use in your life, so that mindfulness becomes a way of life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2475 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2455,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_84,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_85 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "19f47132122709dc1f88c16a122408cb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "That's why I think it is useful to know and practice being mindful when you speak, especially when you are back home and at work."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_2476 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_1347,
