        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_378,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_379,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_380,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e4358bcd53795a75c87c7b23a4c42e51"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I worked with a technique that required energetic, rhythmic breathing and got hooked on the pleasant physical sensation and calm that the experience brought."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_381 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_382,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ee2d03c742498b39d8c7574cf61fe737"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When I told Sayadawgyi about this and that I liked it, he was curious and asked me about my experiences."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_383 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_165,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_26,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_384,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_385,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_386,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_73 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fd8e62b3cc224d50a3fe785d137be61f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "He would tell me stories of other people's special meditation experiences and this would make me want such experiences and motivated me to meditate very diligently."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_387 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_379,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_389,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dbe298ce7a28170bd63c2325a8026573"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "I quickly caught on that when I maintained detailed mindfulness throughout the day, the feelings of calm and pleasantness could be sustained so I was zealous in maintaining mindfulness."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_390 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_391,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_392,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_393,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_73 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e9a88f7127bfcfc2b602cd6a2f2df2a3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "He also told me something that really stuck with me: be happy when I noticed anything about myself because it meant that I was aware of myself, that I was mindful."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_394 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_388,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_395,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b216eaac099a79d0b7fdb3b728e9deef"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "I was so focused on the mindfulness that anything I noticed about myself became a source of joy: it meant I was mindful!"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_396 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_397,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_398,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_399,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "996302366431b6a4ebc2ea62a8f00918"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "It never mattered to me even if I discovered an undesirable quality because the point I saw was that I was mindful."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_400 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_382,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e07f1cc8eef1e48a575294d54c48e20f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Sayadawgyi often asked me why certain things happened when I went to him to describe my experiences."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_401 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_384,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_402,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_403,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_404,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_73 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e697ab740ccde80ffbf36382cb733115"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "One episode in particular was when he asked me to find out why the abdomen rises and falls (that was my main object at that time) and I said it was because of the breath."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_405 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_406,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_73 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9400d144c392357c19d08eb6357ea28b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Then he asked why there was breathing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_407 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_408,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_409,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "11a0c5f42ba4d03203ac026019618905"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I did not know this answer, which prompted a six-day search to find out."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_410 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_403,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_411,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_412,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_413,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_414,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_415,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_416,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e828b49c88c5ca42f0b9cf0780410b8a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Every day, at every sit, the question dogged my observation of the breath and I remember on day six when the curious mind thought about why it was breathing and I saw the desire to breathe."^^xsd:string .

