    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "At home, the practice was forgotten and I got busy having fun with my friends."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_543 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_544,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_545,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_546,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_547 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5ad0a8ce11c7701f6ced05ff6776ec75"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "At University to study engineering, I became so involved in having so much fun with my friends that I flunked my second year of Regional College."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_548 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_549,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_550,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_551,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_552,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_553,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_554,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_555 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1f29300f717aa2f13df18205b594d93e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "At about this time, my oldest brother passed away from leukemia at the age of 43, and my father needed help running his menswear shop in a bustling wholesale center in downtown Yangon, a walking distance from our home."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_556 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_384,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_544,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_551,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_557,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_558,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_559,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_560 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "284947fc92dd236d037606051f996a4e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "My father decided to take me out of University, no doubt a fact that I was a non-doctor in a family filled with brothers and a sister studying medicine."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_56 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_1,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_57,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_58,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_59 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "990cefa55896497b23ed38ce19672c26"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "It doesn't take long for a yogi (meditator) new to Sayadaw U Tejaniya to notice humor permeating his teachings."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_561 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_544,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_559,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_562,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_563,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_564 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb59c7ad619c4e3cd01668561306dc58"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The only other brother not studying medicine had already finished University and was helping my father with the shop."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_565 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_542,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_544,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_564,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_566 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1c6f84b06a733cde25bca73476cff7a5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "I wanted so much to continue to be with my friends that I actually, while helping out at the shop, still tried to repeat my second year at University on my own."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_567 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_508,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_542,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_545,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_547,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_568 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fe1b5858c47b8c3bb8a9386d6d66083a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "It was not as much fun anymore by then because all my friends had already moved on to the main Rangoon University for their third year in Engineering studies while I was still at the Regional College."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_569 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_570 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8b203ac5c31d47b003abbc6fd2310e2d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "It was discouraging, so I stopped trying to repeat the year."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_571 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_516,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_572,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_573,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_574,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_575,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_576 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c3b7ca0ea196b8ceb41e0917c94add89"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I slowly descended into depression from resentment, fear, dissatisfaction, having to do what I did not want to, and not being able to do what I wanted to do."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_577 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
