    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Sayadawgyi just told me to try."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_621 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_586,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_622,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_83,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_97 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0cd59e33b4731544491c5f834ecbea56"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "I accompanied my teacher for a four- to five-day retreat to a monastery about 10 miles out of Bago that he was visiting to give myself a boost."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_623 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_426,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_624,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_83,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_84 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d65b7b79db1975653d921ff3c8ad9ab8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "It was probably my time because I had three insights while meditating at that monastery that gave me some impetus to persevere when I went home."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_625 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_159,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_83 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8add3d35dd969433eed195033e4ad2a3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "When I got to the monastery, I spent my time practicing as I already knew well how to."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_626 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_154,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_627,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_628 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a7e60f951918e593d820dc750145defb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The second day, I sat under a tree because there was not much to do out there, except to watch."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_629 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_353,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_43,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_630,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_631,
        ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_632 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8d68ad57cf87c511a29d1cfa5b355f46"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "It was all trees, with just stillness and as I sat there I guess the silence turned the mind inwards."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_633 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_48486d37_a87c_48ab_920e_41abda1674af_353,
